   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1940-07-01">July 1, 1940</date></dateline><lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Professor Paul Tillich</rs><lb/>
               Union Theological Seminary<lb/>
               <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York City</rs>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Tillich</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>Pardon me for not replying sooner about the research into anti-Semitism which you
               sent me. I have read it with great interest and I am suggesting its use to several
               groups.</p>
            <p>The minds of our people are now so full of national policies and international
               repercussions, however, that it is difficult to get a definition of what can be done
               with a document like this. As the days wear on, perhaps something will emerge.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Cordially yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1054" type="person"
                  ><hi rend="hand">Frank Kingdon</hi></rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
